title: 2031
subtitle: A new year
tags: event
view-if: year = 2031 and month = 1
priority: 2
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1 if budget > 0

A new year begins. The guarantee of a 48% pension level runs out at the end of this year, and the question of what comes after it hangs over every budget debate. More than a million baby-boomers will retire in the next few years.
